{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And Edom shall be a possession.</b> From the stem of ואם לא תורישו. It is in the pattern of קח לך לבנה, and it is a verb under a nominal form, like והיתה הארץ שממה. It is known that the hand of David prevailed over Edom and Mount Seir."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:19.136943356Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}